  "body": "In step 3 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#traverse-the-history-by-a-delta we grab a session history entry's browsing context. Except it stores no such thing. Should it grab that from the session history entry's Document object instead? What if that's not there?\n\nOr maybe it should store a reference to the browsing context?\n\nThis might relate to #1454, which is a little more ambitious and should probably also be done, but maybe we can get there in smaller steps.\n\n@smaug---- @majido \n",
